(text "REED. REED_RET is not GND, UP_RET, DN_RET or GND_CAN. NOT FOR FABRICATION.\\nISO7720FDR is the fail-safe-low orderable part. The KiCad symbol is the shared SOIC-8 pinout.\\nDefault shunt is pins 1-2, Lofrans. Dry contact is the same shunt on pins 2-3. Fit one shunt only." (at 20 270 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "51da3639-6365-4875-8dcd-802f317fa108"))
